-- allium: 4
-- TRIPWIRE for task #61. This component satisfies an imported contract with a WEAKER promise
-- (net>=-3 vs the contract's net>=0), so it should be REFUSED (NOSAT). Today the refinement pass
-- is single-module and cannot see the imported contract, so it wrongly reports NODECL ("no such
-- contract is declared"). The gauntlet pins that current behaviour; when #61 lands and cross-module
-- refinement resolves, this flips to NOSAT and the guard fails — the signal to update the manifest.
use "contract.allium"
component Ledger satisfies (s : Solvent)
  entity Acct
  observable state net(Acct) : Money
  invariant weak means every a :: net(a) >= 0 - 3
end
